      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "desigin file share platfrom\n\nfunctional requirent:\n    1. 1-1 chat with web\n    2. chat with app\n    3. sync file\n\nnon functional requirent:\n    1. 1 B user\n    2. low latency < 500ms\n    3. scalibility\n    4. consistency??\n    4. FT 通常是 Fault Tolerance (容錯)\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "desigin file share platfrom\n\nfunctional requirent:\n    1. 1-1 chat with web\n    2. chat with app\n    3. sync file\n\nnon functional requirent:\n    1. 1 B user\n    2. low latency < 500ms\n    3. scalibility\n    4. consistency??\n    4. FT 通常是 Fault Tolerance (容錯)\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
